  "remarks": "Joint Stock Commercial Bank “FORA-BANK” is a Moscow-based credit institution which is among the top 50 Russian banks by asset size. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, Joint Stock Commercial Bank “FORA-BANK” is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
